description	"The Elite Trooper

Based on open mode's commander class, but given the full set of weapons and double the reinforcements.

^2Weaponry:
- Blaster Pistol (2)
- Blaster Rifle (3)
- DLT-20A Blaster Rifle (3)
- T-21 Blaster Rifle (3)
- 1 Frag Grenade
- 2 Incendiary Grenades

^8Attributes:
- 3 Reinforcements (CTF: 7.5s respawn)
- Assemble (1)

^2Strengths^7: Swarm Tactics and Overwhelming Numbers, Wide array of weapons.
^1Weaknesses^7: Comparatively weak individual troop quality. Weak against Dekas & SBDs."